AltoConvexCreditLineMarket::ProtocolFeeCollector integration
├── given a registered credit market that splits fees between treasury and the collector
│   ├── when part of the fees is claimed directly before harvesting
│   │   ├── it should return the gross amount while the collector receives only its share
│   │   └── it should emit Harvested for only the collector balance increase from the remaining fees
│   └── when distributing after automatic harvesting
│       ├── it should pay the market treasury share directly to rewardRecipient
│       └── it should distribute only the collector balance and report that amount in Distributed
├── given a full treasury share
│   └── it should successfully harvest all fees and emit Harvested with zero received by the collector
└── when the treasury mint fails after the collector mint
    ├── it should emit HarvestingFailed without retaining either payment or the interest accrual
    ├── it should preserve total supply the market minter bucket and claimable fees
    └── it should permit a later successful retry that records only the collector share
